---
title: "C09 — Scoped status resolution · Implemented"
---
flowchart TD
  Path[Selected list ancestor path] --> Workspace[Workspace definitions]
  Workspace --> Space[Apply space overrides]
  Space --> Folder[Apply folder overrides]
  Folder --> List[Apply selected-list overrides]
  List --> Merge[Merge by stable status key and identity]
  Merge --> Visible[Apply nearest explicit visibility]
  Visible --> Sort[Sort by position, key and ID]
  Sort --> Required{not_started, active and done all present?}
  Required -->|Yes| Result[Resolved list-specific set]
  Required -->|No| Reject[Reject invalid configuration]
  Stable[Task statusId is the canonical identity] -. invariant .-> Merge
  Sibling[Resolve sibling lists independently] -. invariant .-> Path
